{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2020-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1590969600, "end_date": 1591574399, "month_true_total": 28, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:05:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "70464842", "author": {"steamid": "76561198988034848", "personaname": "трупоед из южи", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dnestrovskiy/", "num_games_owned": 289, "num_reviews": 80, "playtime_forever": 6029, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6029, "last_played": 1739315198, "avatar": "7050fd0275e98c6bc22afc28e4ffe7055a977daf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alien Swarm is a great game, and it is also a great alternative to Left 4 Dead if you don`t have any spare money on you, the one major difference is that you`re playing from the third-person view though. I suggest bringing some friends along due to the player base becoming smaller and smaller each year. It is a pity that the game has only one official campaign available, Valve themselves don`t care about the game anymore.\n\nIn general, the game is good, and I highly recommend to at least try it. You can even get a free hat for your nice Team Fortress 2 Inventory, so why not? 7.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1591573749, "timestamp_updated": 1739315844, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70293320", "author": {"steamid": "76561198098241276", "personaname": "Lace", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198098241276/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 25, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25, "last_played": 1591289969, "avatar": "61